from a former employee of the appellee.

22
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:26,710
[Judge] [Chief Judge] [People's Assessor]

23
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:28,400
It proves that their technical director
explicitly instructed them

24
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:30,800
