26
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,360
This action,

27
00:01:32,830 --> 00:01:34,979
[Judge] [Chief Judge] [People's Assessor]

28
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,070
we argure,

29
00:01:34,090 --> 00:01:36,800
constitutes intentional circumvention
of copyright management information,

30
00:01:35,110 --> 00:01:36,750
[Case File] [Court Record] [Evidence List]

31
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:38,800
