32
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:39,660
In conclusion,

33
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:42,539
this case is not merely
a simple act of technical plagiarism,

34
00:01:42,539 --> 00:01:44,720
but also a large company
utilizing its resource advantages

35
00:01:44,410 --> 00:01:46,830
[Attorney] [Plaintiff]

36
