Revoke the first-instance judgment.

44
00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:02,580
[Judge] [Chief Judge] [People's Assessor]

45
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,280
The defendant shall
compensate the plaintiff

46
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,800
