No need for dinner.

50
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:20,480
Thank you.

51
00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:22,690
Okay.

52
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,720
I'll leave Senzhou soon.

53
00:02:25,900 --> 00:02:26,560
Okay.

54
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,420
When your studio reopens,

55
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:29,880
I'll definitely be there.

56
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,200
Yeah.

57
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,320
Miss.

58
00:02:32,450 --> 00:02:34,280
Are you here for work?

59
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:36,360
I used to live here.

60
00:02:36,470 --> 00:02:38,079
I'm half a Shanzhou.

61
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,720
If it's jammed here,
we can take Gaochang Road.

62
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:44,560
It's smooth over there too.

63
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,360
Alright.

64
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:46,880
You know the roads well.

65
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:48,680
Half a Senzhou, indeed.

66
00:03:00,910 --> 00:03:01,640
Sir.

67
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,340
Please pull over ahead.

68
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:04,160
Alright.

69
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:51,280
Zhuo Yu'an,

70
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:52,880
how many times have I told you

71
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:54,440
