72
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:57,010
The toes should point outward.

73
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:58,680
Okay.

74
00:04:59,159 --> 00:05:00,290
I'll remember that.

75
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,480
You'll be late for work.

76
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,560
Yeah, let's go.

77
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:37,480
Shu Tinglan, time to eat.

78
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,520
Got it.

79
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,320
You eat first.

80
00:05:41,890 --> 00:05:43,320
Here.

81
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:47,860
You really treat me like a three-year-old.

82
00:05:48,220 --> 00:05:49,640
Aren't you a three-year-old?

83
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:50,640
I can do it myself.

84
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,000
Go ahead and eat.

85
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,520
Try this.

86
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:55,080
Come on, open your mouth.

87
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,159
I just tasted it myself.

88
00:05:56,159 --> 00:05:57,420
It's super delicious.

89
00:05:59,490 --> 00:06:00,680
I can do it myself.

90
00:06:23,220 --> 00:06:26,700
♪ The wind blew you and me apart ♪

91
00:06:26,850 --> 00:06:30,650
♪ We once ran, cried,
and laughed together ♪

92
00:06:30,730 --> 00:06:34,130
♪ Walked all the way through
every twist and turn ♪

93
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:38,050
♪ Yet still missed each other
just as happiness drew near ♪

94
00:06:38,130 --> 00:06:39,659
♪ Only after knowing what it is to lose ♪

95
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:41,500
♪ And never being able to touch again ♪

96
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:45,320
♪ Do we truly know what we had ♪

97
00:06:45,490 --> 00:06:47,640
♪ We loved ♪

98
00:06:48,110 --> 00:06:53,420
♪ Beneath the stars, we froze in time ♪

99
00:07:09,290 --> 00:07:12,650
♪ The wind blew us apart ♪

100
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:16,830
♪ We ran, we cried, we laughed as one ♪

101
00:07:16,990 --> 00:07:20,280
♪ Walked through every twist and turn ♪

102
00:07:20,410 --> 00:07:24,160
♪ Yet still missed each other
just as happiness drew near ♪

103
00:07:24,290 --> 00:07:25,820
♪ Only after knowing what it is to lose ♪

104
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:27,660
♪ And never being able to touch again ♪

105
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:31,580
♪ Can we truly understand
what it means to have ♪

106
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:33,680
♪ We loved ♪

107
00:07:34,230 --> 00:07:39,500
♪ Scattered and frozen
beneath the starry sky ♪

108
00:08:03,190 --> 00:08:04,280
Shu Tinglan.

109
00:08:06,810 --> 00:08:08,880
How long are you going to avoid me?

110
00:08:07,340 --> 00:08:09,890
♪ Under cloudy skies, I look up ♪

111
00:08:10,260 --> 00:08:13,670
♪ Numbness is enough ♪

112
00:08:14,090 --> 00:08:18,870
♪ I don't ask for fairy-tale scenes ♪

113
00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:21,840
I've been keeping the house tidy.

114
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:27,210
♪ Too many lies greet me along the way ♪

115
00:08:23,470 --> 00:08:25,130
You can come anytime you want.

116
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:27,360
Thank you.

117
00:08:28,250 --> 00:08:32,990
♪ I don't expect anyone to stay ♪

118
00:08:28,540 --> 00:08:29,480
Tinglan.

119
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:33,240
We will meet again,

120
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,080
