121
00:08:34,730 --> 00:08:38,610
♪ Then I met you, in this moment ♪

122
00:08:38,700 --> 00:08:41,630
♪ Like drifting into a dream ♪

123
00:08:42,390 --> 00:08:47,670
♪ In the dream, stars carry a boat
toward the shore ♪

124
00:08:46,070 --> 00:08:47,530
Your cuff button came off.

125
00:08:47,710 --> 00:08:48,760
Remember to sew it back on.

126
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:51,150
♪ Your faint light lingers ♪

127
00:08:51,430 --> 00:08:55,560
♪ Spreading a warm current
