131
00:09:07,290 --> 00:09:10,440
♪ I'll have to let go of that tenderness ♪

132
00:09:11,430 --> 00:09:13,860
♪ I need a mouthful of excuses ♪

133
00:09:14,450 --> 00:09:19,630
