148
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:59,510
♪ Lingering in a hazy embrace ♪

149
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,160
Hua'an Hospital.

150
00:10:00,530 --> 00:10:04,510
♪ The clock of fate turns once ♪

151
00:10:04,620 --> 00:10:07,800
♪ Opening that dream ♪

152
00:10:08,470 --> 00:10:11,070
♪ You stand behind me ♪

153
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:10,380
It's okay, Tinglan. Don't worry.

154
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:12,720
