157
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,440
Take your time.

158
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,700
Be careful on the road.

159
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:20,630
♪ Holding my hand ♪

160
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,640
