174
00:10:44,010 --> 00:10:49,330
♪ Walking through the long, long years ♪

175
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:52,920
♪ I once hesitated whether I could stay ♪

176
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:55,070
♪ Stay in your tenderness ♪

177
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,820
♪ Your steadfast eyes ♪

178
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:04,900
♪ Make me stop looking for excuses ♪

179
00:11:01,090 --> 00:11:01,960
Is it for me?

180
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:03,180
