182
00:11:03,930 --> 00:11:04,770
I want!

183
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:08,360
♪ Holding your hand ♪

184
00:11:09,260 --> 00:11:13,050
♪ Crossing the night to greet the day ♪

185
00:11:13,810 --> 00:11:15,800
♪ Leaning in your arms ♪

186
00:11:16,430 --> 00:11:20,060
♪ Light illuminates every
corner of gloom ♪

187
00:11:21,570 --> 00:11:24,350
♪ The vast sky after the rain clears ♪

188
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,760
It's broken.

189
00:11:25,130 --> 00:11:28,250
♪ After the storm, sprouts
grow into a rainbow ♪

190
00:11:28,850 --> 00:11:31,530
♪ No reason needed ♪

191
00:11:30,070 --> 00:11:31,560
After Mom's accident,

192
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:32,960
I looked for you all over the world.

193
00:11:32,430 --> 00:11:39,840
♪ I just want to love you
without holding back ♪

194
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,480
Once I drove too fast

195
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,240
